From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: SpeedBreaker Project <speedbreaker-project@users.noreply.github.com>
Date: Fri, 25 Sep 2026 19:28:03 +0000
Subject: [PATCH] vpkd3d128: implement every pack type and merge (Xenia
 semantics)

Only D3DCOLOR and FLOAT16_4 with fixed merges were handled; other types
emitted a debug trap. NFS: Most Wanted uses NORMSHORT4 (type 4, pack 2)
in-game. A helper in ppc_context.h packs magic-biased floats as Xenia's
PACK sequences do (clamp max-then-min, low mantissa bits; float16 rounds
toward zero) and merges with Xenia's permute controls for every pack and
shift.
---
